{
  "project_id": 20,
  "project_label": "gemma",
  "task_id": 7933,
  "title": "Planning for the end of oil",
  "author": "Richard Sears",
  "url": "https://www.ted.com/talks/richard_sears_planning_for_the_end_of_oil",
  "annotation_id": null,
  "completed_by": 7,
  "created_at": "2026-05-07T10:04:33.652812Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-05-07T10:04:33.652812Z",
  "lead_time": 56.324,
  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "For the next few minutes we're going to talk about energy, and it's going to be a bit of a varied talk.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B39CEF24F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 12,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "spin a story",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BC65BD4F80",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "I'll try to spin a story about energy, and oil's a convenient starting place.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "147AD3DF30",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "The talk will be broadly about energy, but oil's a good place to start.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "65B369192A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "And one of the reasons is this is remarkable stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F095BDBDD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 130,
        "endOffset": 146,
        "text": "marvelous liquid",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FCFB7172A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 238,
        "text": "You take about eight or so carbon atoms, about 20 hydrogen atoms, you put them together in exactly the right way and you get this marvelous liquid: very energy-dense and very easy to refine into a number of very useful products and fuels.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "112E41FA82",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 17,
        "text": "It's great stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F142472459",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "Now, as far as it goes, there's a lot of oil out there in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A376972DD6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "Here's my little pocket map of where it's all located.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2F5251DEA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "for you to look at",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12ECA13365",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "But this is it, this is the oil in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5A67E1EA03",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "Geologists have a pretty good idea of where the oil is.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D66B35ABE4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "This is about 100 trillion gallons of crude oil still to be developed and produced in the world today.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "363827CB14",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 149,
        "text": "Now, that's just one story about oil, and we could end it there and say, \"Well, oil's going to last forever because, well, there's just a lot of it.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D75CCEC12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "But there's actually more to the story than that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "912EBDEA8D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "if you think",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "73B587C59A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 92,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "you're all sitting",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5AD71CFFCA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 167,
        "text": "Oh, by the way, if you think you're very far from some of this oil, 1000 meters below where you're all sitting is one of the largest producing oil fields in the world.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FD11DA5AF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Come talk to me",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "978A8C2470",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 59,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "if you want",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E55365BF36",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "So, that's one of the stories of oil; there's just a lot of it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DFE6F0638A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 19,
        "text": "But what about oil?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8750EC8F97",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "Where is it in the energy system?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1DB780A240",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "Here's a little snapshot of 150 years of oil, and it's been a dominant part of our energy system for most of those 150 years.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF254B8F2E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "I'm going to tell you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "13C78FE962",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "little secret",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "977576B95F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 96,
        "text": "There was one kind of peak oil in 1985, when oil represented 50 percent of global energy supply.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E33A988221",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "Now, it's about 35 percent.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D9BA6CA3DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "It's been declining and I believe it will continue to decline.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "05FC190DB9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 74,
        "text": "Gasoline consumption in the U.S. probably peaked in 2007 and is declining.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4007628C97",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "So oil is playing a less significant role every year.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F88AD0052A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "peak oil; just like, in the 1920s, there was a peak coal; and a hundred years before that, there was a peak wood.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1D54EDC0FB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "This is a very important picture of the evolution of energy systems.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "60BBF9654C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "And what's been taking up the slack in the last few decades?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "33A37411A1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "Well, a lot of natural gas and a little bit of nuclear, for starters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9AA9AC4915",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "And what goes on in the future?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E67197526C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 47,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "peak gas, and beyond that, peak renewables",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3C6FA4B42A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "Now, I'll tell you another little, very important story about this picture.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD9F92CF66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "Now, I'm not pretending that energy use in total isn't increasing, it is -- that's another part of the story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E078030F6B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "Come talk to me about it",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AA1525FC46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 114,
        "endOffset": 153,
        "text": "200 years of history, and for 200 years",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6BA668D358",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 54,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "year on year, decade on decade, century on century",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "83B21E95C2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "And that continues into the future with the renewables that we're developing today, reaching maybe 30 percent of primary energy by mid century.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E832BB7C77",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 42,
        "endOffset": 99,
        "text": "Okay, we just replace it all with conventional renewables",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8856C7CFF3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 162,
        "text": "Now that might be the end of the story -- Okay, we just replace it all with conventional renewables -- but I think, actually, there's more to the story than that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1009533198",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "And to tell the next part of the story -- and this is looking out say 2100 and beyond.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7EA75A393B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "What is the future of truly sustainable, carbon-free energy?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3156BE575B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "Well, we have to take a little excursion, and we'll start in central Texas.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D9B585655",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "Here's a piece of limestone.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52FB763CE0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "I picked it up outside of Marble Falls, Texas.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B422F21C46",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "It's about 400 million years old.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A5036BD978",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "And it's just limestone, nothing really special about it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ABBDEF8D62",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "Now, here's a piece of chalk.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D667E576D8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "I picked this up at MIT.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D9F7ADC39B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "It's a little younger.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "380EA46759",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "And it's different than this limestone, you can see that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "032C45B1F3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 126,
        "text": "You wouldn't build a building out of this stuff, and you wouldn't try to give a lecture and write on the chalkboard with this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5D51F19CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Yeah, it's very different -- no, it's not different.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6FB518B035",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "It's not different, it's the same stuff: calcium carbonate, calcium carbonate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D5A5B62D6F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "What's different is how the molecules are put together.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2899191396",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "Now, if you think that's kind of neat, the story gets really neat right now.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F33838A9CF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 62,
        "text": "Off the coast of California comes this: It's an abalone shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "561F0107E7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "Now, millions of abalone every year make this shell.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7354D3E451",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "Oh, by the way, just in case you weren't already guessing, it's calcium carbonate.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9CCA8A4831",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "It's the same stuff as this and the same stuff as this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6E1FCBF397",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "But it's not the same stuff; it's different.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0A9F1541DA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "It's thousands of times, maybe 3,000 times tougher than this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DE78933ECC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "And why?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FDD3304BC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 122,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "mother of pearl",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD6BDBAB91",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 80,
        "endOffset": 115,
        "text": "all the time, every day, every year",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4DE7A365A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "This is pretty incredible stuff.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6D6ED6BA3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "All the same, what's different?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C31C7254AC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "How the molecules are put together.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "089E75F613",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 43,
        "text": "Now, what does this have to do with energy?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21BDB2A1EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "Here's a piece of coal.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD809471DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 22,
        "endOffset": 66,
        "text": "this coal is about as exciting as this chalk",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D408A8378",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 198,
        "text": "Now, whether we're talking about fuels or energy carriers, or perhaps novel materials for batteries or fuel cells, nature hasn't ever built those perfect materials yet because nature didn't need to.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "39D904AEB0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 168,
        "text": "Nature didn't need to because, unlike the abalone shell, the survival of a species didn't depend on building those materials, until maybe now when it might just matter.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "61C0D481EE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 115,
        "endOffset": 140,
        "text": "energy equivalent of this",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "47FA86E294",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "imagine what would it be like",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3860D2920",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "And so that is my story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EE67DE8AE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "The oil will never run out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "12B3922257",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "It's not because we have a lot of it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8024B8783E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 40,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "bajillion",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90783BA83C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "It's not because we're going to build a bajillion windmills.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3E751DB15F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 120,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "Stone Age ended, not because we ran out of stones",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E11469828",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 60,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "ideas -- they had ideas, innovations, technology",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52725F6EC1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 170,
        "text": "It's because, well, thousands of years ago, people invented ideas -- they had ideas, innovations, technology -- and the Stone Age ended, not because we ran out of stones.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0738389EBF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B99D6206DE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Thank you very much.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "914CFA2393",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CD2083DB8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}